window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>What started out as a relatively simple encounter with two highly attractive women trying to survive in the frozen wilderness is now rapidly becoming more complicated for Chris. His relationship with Lara and Susan is growing into something much more complex and emotional, and on top of that, Jessica has just arrived on their doorstep with her daughter Hannah. She reveals that she has left her neglectful husband for good, and consequently needs a place to stay.</p> <p>While Chris is more than willing to take them in, and to continue the tentative relationship he had begun exploring with Jessica before this whole situation, it soon becomes obvious that her now ex-husband and his bodyguard are not willing to just let this go. As Chris continues his work to provide not just for two women but now four, he's going to have to watch his back more than usual...</p> <p>A WARM PLACE contains intense survival, beautiful women, and scenes of violence.</p>"; 
